Z||000000||Haze_Performance||09-29-2000||04:07 AM||||Is this correct..or was the 2M6 the SE (85-88)??<P>1984<BR>Indy - SE - 2M4 Coupe<P>1985 <BR>GT - SE - 2M4 Coupe - 2M4 Sport Coupe - 2M6<P>1986  <BR>GT - SE - 2M4 Coupe - 2M4 Sport Coupe - 2M6<BR> <BR>1987  <BR>GT - SE - 2M4 Coupe - 2M4 Sport Coupe - 2M6<BR>  <BR>1988  <BR>GT - Formula - 2M4 Coupe - 2M4 Sprot Coupe - 2M6<P>If this is wrong.. Please brake it down for me <P>TIA  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">  <P><B>Website's<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A><P>                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||5
