Z||000003||Haze_Performance||09-29-2000||01:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>Is this correct..or was the 2M6 the SE (85-88)??<P>1984<BR>Indy - SE - 2M4 Coupe<P>1985 <BR>GT - SE - 2M4 Coupe - 2M4 Sport Coupe - 2M6<P>1986  <BR>GT - SE - 2M4 Coupe - 2M4 Sport Coupe - 2M6<BR> <BR>1987  <BR>GT - SE - Coupe - Sport Coupe - 2M6<BR>  <BR>1988  <BR>GT - Formula - Coupe - Sport Coupe <P>If this is wrong.. Please brake it down for me <P>TIA   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>So I guess this is right then?<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/2d_00010aa3.gif">  <P><B>Website's<BR>  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A><P>                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||5
Z||000004||87ECO5||09-29-2000||01:34 PM||||Mark Corbin's <B>Fiero Spotter's Guide</B> says:<P><B>1984</B><BR>- Econo ("Fiero 2M4")<BR>- Sport ("Fiero 2M4")<BR>- SE ("Fiero 2M4")<BR>- Pace Car ("Indy Fiero")<P><B>1985</B><BR>- Econo ("Fiero 2M4")<BR>- Sport ("Fiero 2M4" or "Fiero 2M6")<BR>- SE ("Fiero 2M4" or "Fiero 2M6")<BR>- GT ("Fiero GT")<P><B>1986</B><BR>- Econo ("Fiero 2M4")<BR>- Sport ("Fiero 2M4")<BR>- SE ("Fiero 2M4" or "Fiero 2M6")<BR>- GT ("Fiero GT")<P><B>1987</B><BR>- Econo ("Fiero")<BR>- Sport ("Fiero")<BR>- SE ("Fiero", came with either I4 or V6)<BR>- GT ("Fiero GT")<P><B>1988</B><BR>- Coupe ("Fiero" or "Formula")<BR>- GT ("Fiero GT")<P>Mark's book is pretty accurate.  Only error I've found is no mention of white being available on '87 cars ... which makes mine RARE!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Hope this helps ...<P>------------------<BR><B>Scott S. Haas</B><BR>1987 economy-coupe 5-speed (white/gray)||||reg||1
